🖥️ 8. AWS EC2

Exercise mein AWS-style environment use hua.

EC2 = Cloud Virtual Computer/Server

EC2 instance basically ek virtual computer hai jo cloud mein run karta hai.

Iske paas:

CPU
RAM
Storage
Operating System
Network

ho sakte hain.

🧠 Remember:

EC2 = Cloud mein VM/server

⚙️ 9. Instance Type

Instance type batata hai ki virtual computer kitna powerful hai.

Examples:

t2
t3
m5

General rule:

Bigger instance → More power → Higher cost

Smaller instance → Less power → Lower cost

🌎 10. Cloud Region

Region = Geographical location jahan cloud resources hosted hote hain.

Example:

Europe / North America etc.

Region selection latency, availability aur regulatory requirements jaise factors ko affect kar sakti hai.

