🎯 One-Paragraph Revision

Cloud computing internet ke through computing resources provide karta hai. Virtualization aur containers cloud ko efficient, scalable aur flexible banane mein help karte hain. Cloud ke deployment types Public, Private aur Hybrid hain, jabki service models IaaS, PaaS aur SaaS hain. IaaS mein infrastructure manage karna hota hai, PaaS mein application par focus hota hai, aur SaaS mein ready-made software use karte hain. AWS ka EC2 cloud mein virtual computer/server provide karta hai. Cloud ke major benefits scalability, on-demand resources, pay-as-you-use, high availability, security aur global access hain.
